          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": {
            "zh-CN": "本页是给读者和后续 agent 的公开 workflow 页面；底层维护规则仍以 .cast-docs/WORKFLOW.md 为准。",
            "en": "This page is the public workflow page for readers and future agents; the underlying maintenance rules still live in .cast-docs/WORKFLOW.md."
