              "zh-CN": "每个 plan/spec HTML 都有同名 JSON 源。",
              "en": "Every plan/spec HTML has a same-name JSON source."
            },
            {
              "zh-CN": "每个 plan/spec HTML 都有 zh-CN/en 双语切换结构。",
              "en": "Every plan/spec HTML has zh-CN/en bilingual switch structure."
            },
            {
              "zh-CN": "首页不链接裸目录；reader path 优先链接 HTML 和 README。",
              "en": "Homepage does not link bare directories; reader paths prefer HTML and README."
            },
            {
              "zh-CN": "TODO 只保留开放项，已完成迁移进入 CHANGELIST。",
              "en": "TODO keeps only open items; completed migration moves into CHANGELIST."
